  <!-- Case Study -->
  <section id="case-study" class="section">
    <div class="section__container">
      <h2 class="section__title">Case Study: UK Brand Navigating EU Digital Product Passport</h2>
      <p class="section__text" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        A UK sustainable fashion brand needed to prepare for the EU Digital Product Passport requirement starting 2027. Their current manufacturer lacked traceability systems and couldn't provide the supply chain data required for DPP compliance.
      </p>
      <p class="section__text" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        The brand contacted SDF Clothing for GOTS 7.0 certified production. GOTS 7.0 certification includes the traceability infrastructure needed for Digital Product Passport generation. We provided transaction certificates, supply chain mapping, and material origin documentation.
      </p>
      <p class="section__text" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
